# The flight map menu's Gimbal Video: Full Sized, Mini and Pop Out, and the control's Close.
#
# The claim: the first of them makes GimbalVideoControl and adds Mini map (checked), Swap with map
# and Close to its menu (FlightData.cs:6539-6587). Full Sized puts the video in the map's panel
# with the map the mini map at the bottom right, 30% of the panel each way (6624-6649, 6611-6619).
# The control's Video Stream opens VideoStreamSelector; Connect plays the pipeline typed in its box
# through GStreamer, each frame the control's picture (GimbalVideoControl.cs:311-333, 211-290,
# VideoStreamSelector.cs:37-46). Mini puts the map back filling the panel and the video the mini
# video at the bottom right, fitted to the picture (6651-6676, 6597-6610); the menu then has Swap
# with map and Close. Pop Out puts the video in a window of its own, "Gimbal Control", 600 by 400,
# the map full sized, none of the three items in its menu (6678-6712). Full Sized takes it back
# from the window, still playing. Close is Mini, hidden, Stop, Dispose: the video gone, the map full
# sized, and the next item makes a new control (6563-6569). This machine's map menu is the row
# under the Actions grid, where the other entries are (fly-camera.gui).
#
# Needs SITL (a copter, which has a gimbal manager and a camera object but no gimbal) and the
# GStreamer runtime (gst-launch-1.0 with the base plugins):
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-gimbal-video.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

env XDG_DATA_HOME $WORK
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
screen fly
window 1600x1200
budget 23

# The vehicle first: a click before its first heartbeat is a click the screen may forget.
expect vehicle.count > 0
click fly-tab-actions
expect fly.tab tabActions
expect fly.gimbal.video hidden
expect fly.gimbal.map full

# Full Sized: the video in the panel, the map the mini map.
click map@0.5x0.5:right
expect fly.menu map
hover fly-gimbalvideo
expect fly.menu.sub fly-gimbalvideo
click fly-gimbalvideo-full
expect fly.gimbal.video full
expect fly.gimbal.minimap true
expect fly.gimbal.map mini
expect fly.gimbal.items minimap,swap,close
expect fly.gimbal.minimapbox ~ ,
expect fly.gimbal.frames 0

# Video Stream: a test pipeline typed and connected.
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
expect fly.gimbal.menu true
click fly-gimbal-menu-videostream
expect fly.gimbal.menu false
expect fly.gimbal.selector true
click fly-gimbal-pipeline
type videotestsrc pattern=ball ! appsink name=outsink
expect fly.gimbal.selector.pipeline videotestsrc pattern=ball ! appsink name=outsink
click fly-gimbal-connect
expect fly.gimbal.selector false
expect fly.gimbal.pipeline videotestsrc pattern=ball ! appsink name=outsink
expect fly.gimbal.frames > 10
expect fly.gimbal.frame 320x240

# Mini: the map fills the panel, the video the mini video; still playing.
click map@0.5x0.5:right
expect fly.menu map
hover fly-gimbalvideo
expect fly.menu.sub fly-gimbalvideo
click fly-gimbalvideo-mini
expect fly.gimbal.video mini
expect fly.gimbal.map full
expect fly.gimbal.items swap,close
expect fly.gimbal.minivideo ~ ,
expect fly.gimbal.frames > 20

# Pop Out: its own window, the map full sized, none of the three items.
click map@0.5x0.5:right
expect fly.menu map
hover fly-gimbalvideo
expect fly.menu.sub fly-gimbalvideo
click fly-gimbalvideo-popout
expect fly.gimbal.video popout
expect fly.gimbal.map full
expect fly.gimbal.items none

# Full Sized takes it back from the window: the same control, still playing.
# The pop-out form sits centred over the window, 600 by 400, so the map is pressed off-centre.
click map@0.15x0.2:right
expect fly.menu map
hover fly-gimbalvideo
expect fly.menu.sub fly-gimbalvideo
click fly-gimbalvideo-full
expect fly.gimbal.video full
expect fly.gimbal.map mini
expect fly.gimbal.pipeline videotestsrc pattern=ball ! appsink name=outsink

# Close: gone, stopped, the map full sized.
click fly-gimbal-video-box:right
click fly-gimbal-menu-close
expect fly.gimbal.video hidden
expect fly.gimbal.map full
expect fly.gimbal.frames 0
expect fly.gimbal.pipeline none

# The next item makes a new control, with no stream.
click map@0.5x0.5:right
expect fly.menu map
hover fly-gimbalvideo
expect fly.menu.sub fly-gimbalvideo
click fly-gimbalvideo-popout
expect fly.gimbal.video popout
expect fly.gimbal.pipeline none
click fly-gimbal-popout-close
expect fly.gimbal.video hidden
